WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.948 --> 00:00:06.384
Scan JetBrains, then Cluster skills: “Listing JetBrains’s repositories…”, the button disabled

2
00:00:06.384 --> 00:00:10.950
The organization scanned again, as its own scan shows it: “Scanned 3 of 5 repositories” and the repositories’ bar

3
00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:14.515
Then haiku: “Clustering 7 skills with haiku…”, and a bar of the skills from 0 in the repositories’ bar’s place

4
00:00:14.515 --> 00:00:16.584
The answer so far, “[3, 5”: 3 is whole, 5 may still grow; “Clustered 1 of 7 skills with haiku…”

5
00:00:16.584 --> 00:00:18.667
Then “3, 5, 3, 9, 1, 2] … [7,”: build named again and 9, not in the list, do not count; 5 of 7

6
00:00:18.667 --> 00:00:20.786
All 7 placed: the bar full, and the same spinner turning since clustering began

7
00:00:20.786 --> 00:00:22.858
The answer: 7 skills in 2 clusters, the bar gone, the button enabled again
